# TG BRCA RNA-seq pipeline

## Data
- Dir: `E:/R/TG_BRCA/TG` (fallback: script/repo dir)
- Input: Cuffdiff `genes.read_group_tracking`, then `genes.count_tracking` / `genes.fpkm_tracking`
- Samples: `NTC_rep0`, `NTC_rep1`, `TG_sh1`, `TG_sh5` (do not collapse the two NTC samples except in design 2)
- Human `org.Hs.eg.db`

## Preprocess (once, all samples together)
Filter low expression, then normalize (DESeq2 size factors if counts; quantile log2 if FPKM).

## Four designs (each gets its own plots; never merge NTC_rep0 with NTC_rep1 except design 2)
1. Pairwise 1-vs-1, separately: `TG_sh1 vs NTC_rep0`, `TG_sh5 vs NTC_rep0`, `TG_sh1 vs NTC_rep1`, `TG_sh5 vs NTC_rep1`. log2FC from normalized values; no p-value (1 vs 1).
2. Combined: mean(TG_sh1, TG_sh5) vs NTC group mean(NTC_rep0, NTC_rep1). Equal weight to the two knockdowns.
3. Common up vs NTC_rep0: intersection of upregulated genes from `TG_sh1 vs NTC_rep0` and `TG_sh5 vs NTC_rep0`.
4. Common up vs NTC_rep1: intersection of upregulated genes from `TG_sh1 vs NTC_rep1` and `TG_sh5 vs NTC_rep1`.

## Subset grid (every design, do not skip a cutoff)
- FC up: 1, 1.25, 1.5, 2
- Top up: 50, 75, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300
- Pairwise/common: FC/rank only. Combined: `padj < 0.05` if estimable, else FC/rank only.

## Plots in every non-empty subset
DE table + barplot, volcano (or MA if no p-value), heatmap, GO, pathway, KEGG, GSEA. Folders: `GO/`, `Pathway/`, `KEGG/`, `GSEA/`. Relax cutoffs and label figures if no significant terms.
